/**
 * A custom codec that safely deserializes JSON arrays into Java arrays.
 *
 * <p>This implementation adds strict type validation to mitigate deserialization
 * attacks that could arise from older versions of Fastjson. Only a predefined
 * set of safe component types is allowed. Any attempt to deserialize an array
 * whose component type is not on the whitelist will result in an
 * {@link IllegalArgumentException}.</p>
